OL,4,CTory plan to sell off London's         
OL,5,CVictorian jails to raise #1.4bn        
OL,6,GLondon's Victorian jails should be     
OL,7,Gclosed down and the land sold off to   
OL,8,Gproperty developers, the Conservatives 
OL,9,Ghave said, as they launched a plan to  
OL,10,Gmassively increase prison places in    
OL,11,GEngland and Wales.                     
OL,13,FShadow justice secretary Nick Timothy  
OL,14,Fsaid the move could raise #1.4bn to    
OL,15,Fhelp fund the construction of "modern, 
OL,16,Fpurpose-built prisons elsewhere".      
OL,18,FHe claimed a Tory government would     
OL,19,Fcreate 50,000 extra prison places      
OL,20,Fwithin "six or seven years" and end    
OL,21,FLabour's early release scheme in its   
OL,22,Ffirst term in office.             G1/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
