OL,3,W"###"###"###T///-./-,,-,.,/,/,-,.,,.///
OL,4,CPrince William meets Burnham on first  
OL,5,CDowning Street visit                   
OL,6,GThe Prince of Wales walked up Downing  
OL,7,GStreet for the first time, as he       
OL,8,Gvisited Prime Minister Andy Burnham.   
OL,10,FBehind the black door of No 10, Prince 
OL,11,FWilliam is expected to talk to Burnham 
OL,12,Fabout issues including homelessness,   
OL,13,Fwith both the prime minister and the   
OL,14,Fprince committed to tackling the       
OL,15,Fproblem.                               
OL,17,FThe two men have met before, such as   
OL,18,Fthe Omani state visit last month,      
OL,19,Fwhere they both attended the state     
OL,20,Fbanquets at Windsor Castle.            
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
