OL,3,W"###"###"###T///-./-,,-,.,/,/,-,.,,.///
OL,4,CState failing to keep public safe,     
OL,5,Cwarns victims' commissioner            
OL,6,GThe victims' commissioner for England  
OL,7,Gand Wales has said the state is        
OL,8,Gfailing to keep the public safe, as    
OL,9,Gshe urged Andy Burnham to put the      
OL,10,Gjustice system at the heart of his 10- 
OL,11,Gyear plan for government.              
OL,13,FClaire Waxman told the BBC that she    
OL,14,Fwould press the prime minister to      
OL,15,Fcommit to reforms in the decade-long   
OL,16,Fblueprint, which he is set to unveil   
OL,17,Fnext month.                            
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
